from pathlib import Path
import subprocess,re
root=Path(__file__).resolve().parents[3]
out=Path(__file__).resolve().parent
for mode in ['before','after']:
 def read(path):
  return subprocess.check_output(['git','show','ee00f15:'+path],cwd=root,text=True) if mode=='before' else (root/path).read_text()
 (out/(mode+'.css')).write_text(read('code/design-system/css/components.css'))
 scroll=read('code/components/ScrollToTopButton.tsx')
 duration=re.search(r'transition: transform ([^;]+);',scroll).group(1).replace('${DEFAULT_EASING}','cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)')
 index=read('code/components/IndexPage.tsx')
 block=index.split('  .idx-view-toggle-option {',1)[1].split('  .idx-view-toggle-option[data-active',1)[0]
 transition=re.search(r'transition:\s*([^;]+);',block).group(1).replace('${SMOOTH_EASE}','cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1)')
 (out/(mode+'.html')).write_text('''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>'''+mode.title()+''' · Polish preview</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="../../design-system/tokens/tokens.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../../design-system/css/base.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="'''+mode+'''.css">
<style>body{margin:0;padding:24px;background:var(--mh-bg-page,#f7f5f0);color:var(--mh-text-primary,#141414)}h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 24px}h2{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 12px}section{border-top:1px solid currentColor;padding:24px 0}p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;max-width:50ch}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;background:none;border:0;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor;outline-offset:4px}.toggle{display:flex;gap:8px;font-family:var(--mh-font-mono,monospace);font-size:13px;line-height:28px}.idx-view-toggle-option{padding:0;transition:'''+transition+''';opacity:1}.idx-view-toggle-option[aria-pressed="true"]{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}.idx-view-toggle-option:hover{color:#979797;opacity:1}.mh-scroll-top-button{display:block;margin:24px 0;font-family:var(--mh-font-mono,monospace);font-size:13px}.mask{display:block;height:16px;overflow:hidden}.mh-scroll-top-label-rail{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;transform:translateY(0);transition:transform '''+duration+''';}.mh-scroll-top-label-rail span{height:16px;flex:0 0 16px;line-height:16px}.mh-scroll-top-button:is(:hover,:focus-visible) .mh-scroll-top-label-rail{transform:translateY(-20px)}.mh-media{max-width:480px}.mh-lightbox{z-index:100}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.mh-scroll-top-label-rail{transition:none!important;transform:none!important}}</style>
<h1>'''+('Current' if mode=='before' else 'Polish proposal')+'''</h1>
<section><h2>Grid / List feedback</h2><div class="toggle" role="group" aria-label="Project view"><button class="idx-view-toggle-option" aria-pressed="false">GRID</button><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><button class="idx-view-toggle-option" aria-pressed="true">LIST</button></div><p>Existing underline and color behavior. The added opacity transition has no visible effect while opacity stays at 1.</p></section>
<section><h2>Scroll-to-top label</h2><button class="mh-scroll-top-button"><span class="mask"><span class="mh-scroll-top-label-rail"><span>SCROLL TO TOP ↑</span><span aria-hidden="true">SCROLL TO TOP ↑</span></span></span></button><p>Hover or focus to compare the rollover: '''+('500ms' if mode=='before' else '400ms')+'''.</p></section>
<section><h2>Media hover & lightbox</h2><div data-mh-lightbox><button class="mh-flip-host" aria-label="Open Gaia image" style="display:block;padding:0;width:100%"><span class="mh-media"><img src="../../design-system/assets/samples/gaia.jpg" alt="Gaia app in a field of daisies"></span></button></div><p>Hover the image, then click to open. Press Escape to close. Lightbox timings: '''+('260ms open / 260ms close' if mode=='before' else '250ms open / 150ms close')+'''. This is the design-system example, not the live Framer lightbox.</p></section>
<script src="../../design-system/js/components.js"></script><script>document.querySelectorAll('.idx-view-toggle-option').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>document.querySelectorAll('.idx-view-toggle-option').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b))));</script></html>''')
(out/'index.html').write_text('''<!doctype html><html lang="en"><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Portfolio · Polish motion review</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#f7f5f0;color:#233324;font:16px system-ui}header{padding:24px 32px;border-bottom:1px solid}h1{font-size:28px;margin:0 0 8px}p{max-width:85ch;line-height:1.5}main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}iframe{width:100%;height:1100px;border:0}iframe+iframe{border-left:1px solid #aaa;box-sizing:border-box}@media(max-width:700px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr}iframe{height:1050px}}a{color:inherit}</style><header><h1>Polish motion review</h1><p>Compare the current treatment with the service-generated Polish changes. Hover the labels and images; open and close the image viewer. This isolated comparison does not change the live site.</p><p>Polish adjusts existing motion. It does not add the previously proposed sliding underline, skeleton loader, animated count, or mobile dropdown choreography.</p><a href="after.html">Open proposed treatment alone ↗</a></header><main><iframe src="before.html" title="Current motion"></iframe><iframe src="after.html" title="Proposed Polish motion"></iframe></main></html>''')
